      {terminal:{title:'🖥️ Recover an unresolved TEST refund',goal:'<p>Original TEST order-101 is CAPTURED once, stock 0. Correct Standard ASL already exists, but refund-test has environment PROVIDER_AVAILABLE=false. No external provider is called.</p><p><b>1.</b> Update refund-test using environment file refund-env.json (Variables PROVIDER_AVAILABLE string true). <b>2.</b> Wait function-updated-v2; stored pending configuration is not current readiness. <b>3.</b> Start refund-saga with execution name refund-recovery and refund-input.json. <b>4.</b> Get exact recovery execution history.</p><p>Expect OutOfStock then TEST refund, final REFUNDED, captureCount 1/refundCount 1/reserveCount 0 and stock 0. Preserve original intent, role, stock, queues and workers. Reset/delete, a fake Pass label, wrong order or an unrelated history cannot qualify. After any closed failed attempt, choose a fresh execution name, keep the same orderId, and read the new exact ARN.</p>',account:seed(true),files,tasks:iTasks,solution:iSolution,hints:['A pending capture remains visible until a durable compensation result exists. Configuration update must become ready before recovery.',iSolution.slice(0,2).join(' phir '),iSolution.slice(2).join(' phir ')],success:AG.allOf(iTasks),successText:'Original pending TEST capture recovered to REFUNDED once. Configuration readiness and exact execution history agree; capture did not repeat and stock did not decrement. No real payment/ASL/Lambda runtime claim.'}}
